  "$comment": "Hand-derived from xorgate-core-service src/schemas/capabilities.ts (the zod schema provisioning parses with). This file is the SDK's copy of that contract; scripts/generate.mjs turns it into src/generated/capabilities.ts. When capabilities.ts changes upstream, xorgate-core-service's test/sdk-vendor-drift.test.ts fails and points here. schemaVersion 2 (cm4-support plan) adds the platform facts the device agent turns into mechanism: system.platform/encoder/rails/statusLed, per-video connector+sensor, sensors.imu.model. The root dispatches on schemaVersion, mirroring the upstream z.discriminatedUnion; statusLed is nullable, which the generated checker's null-as-absent rule already covers.",
